{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/true-hourly-wage/layout,_N_T_/tools/true-hourly-wage/page,_N_T_/tools/true-hourly-wage"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--30Dh3F_gwThwhWHzEqvhC--><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/d2c1ffb734f61872-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/be89a9700d24476f.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/b060768bd19d627c.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-afaa36114f407091.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-cb395327542b56ef.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-e48a0c0fd545761a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-e78f5894d0a0b16c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/page-f6d4c9d14c709db5.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/true-hourly-wage/page-9bdaa50f89d81042.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-3591490977493759\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>쓱싹 - 유용한 정보 블로그</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그. 금융, 건강, IT, 생활정보 등 쉽게 알려드립니다.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"금융, 투자, 건강, IT, 테크, 생활정보, 자격증, 보험\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><meta name=\"google-adsense-account\" content=\"ca-pub-3591490977493759\"/><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"05uSSCwIsJLxLnMlswVBzMSOwEeGCOkpMhx9YJMZcng\"/><meta name=\"naver-site-verification\" content=\"f82b9ef52a15379f29a3f6d9ffe4dd6b9d6cc43b\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"쓱싹 - 유용한 정보 블로그\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sseuksak.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://sseuksak.com/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"쓱싹 - 유용한 정보 블로그\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://sseuksak.com/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"url\":\"https://sseuksak.com\",\"name\":\"쓱싹\",\"description\":\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그\",\"inLanguage\":\"ko-KR\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":\"https://sseuksak.com/search?q={search_term_string}\",\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"쓱싹\",\"url\":\"https://sseuksak.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://sseuksak.com/logo.svg\"},\"sameAs\":[],\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer service\",\"availableLanguage\":\"Korean\"}}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__className_9f2754 antialiased bg-white\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b border-gray-200\"><nav class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center h-16\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600\">쓱싹</span></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8\"><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/finance\">금융/투자</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/insurance\">보험/법률</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/health\">건강/의료</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/tech\">IT/테크</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/education\">교육/자격증</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/lifestyle\">생활정보</a></div><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-100\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><main class=\"flex-grow\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\"><nav class=\"mb-6\"><a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/tools\">← 도구 목록으로</a></nav><div class=\"text-center mb-8\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">진짜 시급 계산기</h1><p class=\"text-gray-600\">출퇴근, 야근, 업무 지출까지 포함한 실제 시급을 계산해요</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">기본 정보</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 mb-6\"><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">월급 (세후)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" step=\"100000\" value=\"3000000\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">주당 근무시간</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" value=\"40\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">주당 야근시간</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" value=\"5\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">출퇴근 왕복 (분)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" value=\"60\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">주당 근무일</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" min=\"1\" max=\"7\" value=\"5\"/></div></div></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">업무 관련 지출</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">점심값 (일)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" step=\"1000\" value=\"10000\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">커피/간식 (일)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" step=\"1000\" value=\"5000\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">업무용 의류/미용 (월)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" step=\"10000\" value=\"100000\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">기타 지출 (월)</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-500\" step=\"10000\" value=\"50000\"/></div></div></div><button class=\"w-full py-3 bg-green-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-green-700 transition-colors\">진짜 시급 계산하기</button></div><div class=\"mt-8 bg-green-50 rounded-xl border border-green-200 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3\">핵심 개념: 돈 = 생명 에너지</h3><blockquote class=\"border-l-4 border-green-400 pl-4 italic text-gray-700 mb-4\">&quot;돈이 무엇이든 간에, 한 가지 진실은 모두에게 적용돼요: <strong>돈은 당신의 생명 에너지와 교환하는 것</strong>입니다. 당신은 시간으로 돈을 삽니다. 그리고 그 교환은 생각보다 좋지 않아요.&quot;</blockquote><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">— &quot;Your Money or Your Life&quot; (Vicki Robin &amp; Joe Dominguez)</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">YMOYL의 4가지 숨겨진 비용</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">공식 시급에는 이 비용들이 빠져있어요. 진짜 시급을 알려면 모두 고려해야 해요.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 text-sm\">Getting Ready (준비)</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-2\">출근 준비에 들어가는 시간과 비용</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">시간:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">옷 고르기</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">화장/면도</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">머리 손질</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">비용:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">업무용 의류</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">미용/이발</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">세탁비</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 text-sm\">Commuting (통근)</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-2\">출퇴근에 들어가는 시간과 비용</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">시간:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">왕복 출퇴근</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">대중교통 대기</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">주차</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">비용:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">교통비</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">기름값</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">주차비</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">자동차 유지비</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 text-sm\">Extras (추가비용)</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-2\">업무와 관련된 추가 지출</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">시간:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">업무 회식</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">네트워킹</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">점심 약속</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">비용:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">점심값</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">커피</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">회식비</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">업무용품</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 text-sm\">Recovery (회복)</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-2\">일 때문에 필요한 휴식과 스트레스 해소</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">시간:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">퇴근 후 멍때리기</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs rounded\">주말 회복 시간</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">비용:</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">스트레스 해소 쇼핑</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">술</span><span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs rounded\">배달음식</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl border border-yellow-200 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3\">이렇게 활용해보세요</h3><div class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700\"><p><strong>물건을 살 때:</strong> &quot;이 물건은 <!-- -->X시간<!-- --> 일해야 살 수 있어. 그만한 가치가 있을까?&quot;</p><p><strong>추가 근무할 때:</strong> &quot;야근 1시간 = <!-- -->X원<!-- -->의 내 생명 에너지&quot;</p><p><strong>이직 고민할 때:</strong> &quot;연봉이 올라도 출퇴근이 1시간 늘면 진짜 시급은?&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3\">진짜 시급이란?</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li>• 1992년 출간된 <strong>&quot;Your Money or Your Life&quot;</strong> 책에서 유명해진 개념이에요</li><li>• 단순 급여 / 근무시간이 아닌, <strong>실제 투입되는 모든 시간과 비용</strong>을 계산해요</li><li>• 출퇴근, 야근, 점심값, 업무 의류, 스트레스 해소 비용까지 포함해요</li><li>• 물건을 살 때 &quot;이거 사려면 몇 시간 일해야 하지?&quot;라고 생각하면 소비 습관이 바뀌어요</li><li>• 직장을 바꿀 때도 연봉뿐 아니라 <strong>진짜 시급</strong>을 비교해보세요</li></ul><div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">참고: &quot;Your Money or Your Life&quot; by Vicki Robin &amp; Joe Dominguez (1992), yourmoneyoryourlife.com</p></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">쓱싹</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그입니다. 금융, 건강, IT 등 생활에 도움이 되는 정보를 쉽게 알려드립니다.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">바로가기</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/about\">소개</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/contact\">연락처</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/privacy\">개인정보처리방침</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/terms\">이용약관</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">카테고리</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/finance\">금융/투자</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/health\">건강/의료</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/tech\">IT/테크</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/lifestyle\">생활정보</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200\"><p class=\"text-center text-gray-500 text-sm\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --